Harry Styles to Return to &#8216;Saturday Night Live&#8217; as Host & Musical Guest 7 Years After His&nbsp;Debut

Here&#8217;s Everything We Know About Harry Styles&#8217; New Album &#8216;Kiss All the Time. Disco, Occasionally&#8217; (So&nbsp;Far)

Harry Styles on His Love for Italy and How He’s Slowing Down After&nbsp;Hiatus

While appearing on an episode of Brittany Broski&#8217;s Royal Court posted Wednesday (Feb. 25), Styles revealed that he&#8217;s on Raya — a private, members-only matchmaking platform — while talking about how he&#8217;s picked up some Italian while spending time in Rome recently. Explaining how he practices the language, the singer said he does it by &#8220;mostly just talking with friends, and I do a little bit of the app, too — Raya.&#8221;

After Broski and her crew burst out laughing, Styles quipped mischievously, &#8220;Just for grammar and stuff — it&#8217;s good to be seeing [the language] all the time. Just being immersed in it is the best way to learn.&#8221;

The interview comes just more than a week ahead of the Brit&#8217;s fourth studio album, Kiss All the Time. Disco, Occasionally , which drops March 6. Leading up to the project&#8217;s release, fans spotted Styles out and about in Italy multiple times — including during the unveiling of Pope Leo XIV at the Vatican on May 8. (Zoe Kravitz, whom he was rumored to be dating, was also part of many of those sightings.)

Elsewhere during Royal Court , Styles shared that his hidden talent is eating &#8220;quite a lot&#8221; of yogurt — &#8220;No, I eat, like, remarkable amounts of yogurt &#8230; it shocks my friends,&#8221; he said — and identified which of his 2010s fashion choices he most regrets. &#8220;I think I wore, like, really, really tight jeans,&#8221; he told Broski. &#8220;They were tighter than my legs were. So now, I&#8217;d be like, &#8216;Just wear a size bigger — or three sizes bigger.'&#8221;

The One Direction alum also spent a lot of time praising Rosalía on her November album Lux . &#8220;I think it&#8217;s great. So brilliant,&#8221; he said of the project. &#8220;What is really inspiring to see when you see something like Lux is it&#8217;s so obviously for her. It&#8217;s so obviously to fulfill something that we get to watch.&#8221;

So far, fans have heard only one song off Kiss All the Time. Disco, Occasionally : &#8220;Aperture,&#8221; which debuted atop the Billboard Hot 100 earlier in February. Some people, however, got to experience the album in full at recent listening parties in different cities across the globe.

